  <!-- 
  ==============================================================================
  IMPORTANT NOTES & BEST PRACTICES
  ==============================================================================
  
  IMAGE SEO CHECKLIST:
  ✓ Use descriptive filenames (not IMG_1234.jpg)
  ✓ Compress images (use WebP, optimize JPG/PNG)
  ✓ Add detailed alt text and captions
  ✓ Include geo-location for local SEO
  ✓ Use high-quality, original images (not stock photos)
  ✓ Specify image license if applicable
  ✓ Keep file sizes under 200KB when possible
  ✓ Use responsive images (srcset)
  
  PRIVACY & COMPLIANCE:
  ✗ NEVER include kid photos without parental consent
  ✗ NEVER include profile pictures of users
  ✗ NEVER include screenshots with personal data
  ✗ NEVER include user-generated content without permission
  ✓ Only use generic, non-identifying images
  ✓ Use stock photos or created graphics for marketing
  ✓ Get written consent for testimonial photos
  
  IMAGE FORMATS:
  - WebP: Best for web (smaller file sizes, good quality)
  - PNG: Transparent backgrounds, logos, icons
  - JPG: Photos, complex images
  - SVG: Vector graphics, icons, logos (scalable)
  
  OPTIMIZATION TOOLS:
  - TinyPNG (compression)
  - ImageOptim (Mac)
  - Squoosh (online)
  - Cloudflare Polish (automatic)
  - WebP converter tools
  
  MAINTENANCE:
  - Add new images immediately after upload
  - Update captions to improve SEO
  - Remove deleted/404 images
  - Compress large images regularly
  - Monitor image indexing in Search Console
  - Track image search traffic in Analytics
  
  DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST:
  ✓ Replace 'your-domain.com' with actual domain
  ✓ Verify all image URLs are accessible (200 status)
  ✓ Check image file sizes (<200KB recommended)
  ✓ Validate alt text and captions
  ✓ Test XML validity
  ✓ Submit to Google Search Console
  ✓ Monitor image indexing
  
  ADVANCED TIPS:
  ✓ Use CDN for faster image loading
  ✓ Implement lazy loading
  ✓ Add structured data (schema.org)
  ✓ Use responsive images (multiple sizes)
  ✓ Add EXIF data (camera info, location)
  ✓ Create image thumbnails
  ✓ Use alt text for accessibility
  
  ==============================================================================
  END OF IMAGE SITEMAP - AccellaX 361°
